    "Usage Profile must use the columns usage_area, status, example_sentence, note.",
    "Usage Profile must include distinct examples for each usage area.",
    "Word Nature must contain primary_classification first and reason second.",
    "Tamil Usage Notes must appear immediately after Word Nature.",
    "Every lesson section should be useful for recall, speaking, and Tamil-speaker mistake correction.",
    "Do not generate Meaning Layers or Practice + Evaluation sections.",
    "Use exactly 17 lesson sections."
